{"id":"d9c7505f9ccdb5ad","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-congruence-permutable.md","title":"thm-congruence-permutable","display":"thm-congruence-permutable","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","depends_on":["[[93-df-congruence]]","[[93-df-permutable]]","[[93-df-malcev-term]]"],"display":"thm-congruence-permutable","label":"93-thm-congruence-permutable","aliases":["93-thm-congruence-permutable"],"type":"theorem"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"30b341bfbd8b5301\" href=\"?note=30b341bfbd8b5301\" title=\"93-df-congruence\">93-df-congruence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b4de3484ad8d9669\" href=\"?note=b4de3484ad8d9669\" title=\"93-df-permutable\">93-df-permutable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d57b5a54109bb025\" href=\"?note=d57b5a54109bb025\" title=\"93-df-malcev-term\">93-df-malcev-term</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-congruence-permutable"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-congruence-permutable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-congruence-permutable</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-congruence-permutable-thm-congruence-permutable\">thm-congruence-permutable <code>thm-congruence-permutable</code></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> is fixed and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> is a variety candidate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CPerm}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{CPerm}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MalcevTerm}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{MalcevTerm}_{93}\\)</span> are sourced from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b4de3484ad8d9669\" href=\"?note=b4de3484ad8d9669\" title=\"93-df-permutable\">93-df-permutable</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d57b5a54109bb025\" href=\"?note=d57b5a54109bb025\" title=\"93-df-malcev-term\">93-df-malcev-term</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}congruence\\text{-}permutable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CPerm}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists p\\;\\mathrm{MalcevTerm}_{93}(p,\\mathcal V;\\tau)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}congruence\\text{-}permutable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CPerm}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists p\\;\\mathrm{MalcevTerm}_{93}(p,\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The two displayed identities are the Mal'cev term condition; naming an unspecified “Malcev term” without its identities does not formalize the characterization.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-congruence-permutable-thm-congruence-permutable","text":"thm-congruence-permutable `thm-congruence-permutable`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-congruence","status":"resolved","id":"30b341bfbd8b5301","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-permutable","status":"resolved","id":"b4de3484ad8d9669","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-permutable]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-malcev-term","status":"resolved","id":"d57b5a54109bb025","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-malcev-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-permutable","status":"resolved","id":"b4de3484ad8d9669","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CPerm}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{MalcevTerm}_{93}$ are sourced from [[93-df-permutable]] and [[93-df-malcev-term]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-malcev-term","status":"resolved","id":"d57b5a54109bb025","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CPerm}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{MalcevTerm}_{93}$ are sourced from [[93-df-permutable]] and [[93-df-malcev-term]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CPerm}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MalcevTerm}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}congruence\\text{-}permutable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CPerm}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists p\\;\\mathrm{MalcevTerm}_{93}(p,\\mathcal V;\\tau)","display":true}],"bytes":889,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["30b341bfbd8b5301","b4de3484ad8d9669","d57b5a54109bb025"]}